{"id":"nce1-093","book":"nce1","numbers":[93,94],"label":"Lesson 93–94","titleEn":"Our New Neighbour","titleCn":"我们的新邻居","audio":"media/lessons/nce1/093.mp3","lines":[{"t":3.01,"en":"Our new neighbour","cn":"我们的新邻居"},{"t":6.03,"en":"Listen to the tape then answer this question.","cn":"先听这段录音，然后再回答这个问题。"},{"t":11.98,"en":"Why is Nigel a lucky man?","cn":"为什么奈杰尔是个幸运的人？"},{"t":17.19,"en":"Nigel is our new next-door neighbour.","cn":"奈杰尔是我们的新邻居，住在我们隔壁。"},{"t":21.64,"en":"He's a pilot.","cn":"他是一名飞行员。"},{"t":24.16,"en":"He was in the R.A.F.","cn":"他曾在英国皇家空军（R.A.F.）服役。"},{"t":28.29,"en":"He will fly to New York next month.","cn":"他下个月将飞往纽约。"},{"t":33.19,"en":"The month after next he'll fly to Tokyo.","cn":"下下个月，他将飞往东京。"},{"t":38.62,"en":"At the moment, he's in Madrid.","cn":"目前，他在马德里。"},{"t":42.31,"en":"He flew to Spain a week ago.","cn":"他一周前飞去了西班牙。"},{"t":46.58,"en":"He'll return to London the week after next.","cn":"他将在下下周回到伦敦。"},{"t":52.15,"en":"He's only forty-one years old,","cn":"他才四十一岁。"},{"t":55.89,"en":"and he has already been to nearly every country in the world.","cn":"他已经去过世界上几乎所有的国家了。"},{"t":63.42,"en":"Nigel is a very lucky man.","cn":"奈杰尔是个非常幸运的人。"},{"t":67.2,"en":"But his wife isn't very lucky.","cn":"不过他的妻子运气不太好。"},{"t":70.52,"en":"She usually stays at home!","cn":"她通常待在家里！"}],"words":[{"word":"pilot","phonetic":["'pailət"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"飞行员","us":"media/words/nce1/w0642_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0642_e.mp3"},{"word":"return","phonetic":["ri'tə:n"],"pos":"v.","meaning":"返回","us":"media/words/nce1/w0643_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0643_e.mp3"},{"word":"New York","phonetic":["'nju: 'jɔ:k"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"纽约","us":null,"uk":"media/words/nce1/w0644_e.mp3"},{"word":"Tokyo","phonetic":["'təukjəu"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"东京","us":"media/words/nce1/w0645_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0645_e.mp3"},{"word":"Madrid","phonetic":["mə'drid"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"马德里","us":"media/words/nce1/w0646_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0646_e.mp3"},{"wor